---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import "../styles/prose.css";
---

<BaseLayout title="About">
  <section class="prose page">
    <h1>About Tarmac</h1>
    <p>
      Tarmac is a landing strip for curious investigations — data-driven deep dives
      where the interactive charts are the point, not an illustration bolted onto
      the prose.
    </p>
    <p>
      Each investigation is built from a documented data pipeline, with sources and
      methodology notes alongside the charts so you can check the work.
    </p>
    <p>
      Site by <a href="https://github.com/ktarrant">Kevin Tarrant</a>. Article text
      and charts are CC BY 4.0 unless noted; the code is GPL-3.0.
    </p>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page {
    padding: 2rem 1rem 4rem;
  }
</style>
